Source:@PACKAGE_NAME@
Maintainer: zhiming <@PACKAGE_BUGREPORT@>
Section:devel
Priority:extra
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13~), autoconf, automake, pkg-config, libtool, bison, flex, gcc ( >= 5 ), libdbus-1-dev, libjsoncpp-dev, liblz4-dev, @FUSE3_DEBLIBS@ @KRB5_DEBLIBS@ @OPENSSL_DEBLIBS@ libcppunit-dev, vim, python3, @JAVA_DEBLIBS@ @PYTHON_DEBLIBS@ @JS_DEBLIBS@ devscripts, bash, gettext
X-Python3-Version: >= 3.7
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/zhiming99/rpc-frmwrk.git
Homepage: https://github.com/zhiming99/rpc-frmwrk

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus-daemon, dbus-bin, @FUSE3_DEBPKGS@ @OPENSSL_DEBPKGS@  @JAVA_DEBPKGS@ @PYTHON_DEBPKGS@ bash, attr, procps, python3-urwid, locales
Description: RPC-frmwrk is a small event-driven, asynchronous RPC framework with high performance and high flexibility. And this package contains rpcrouter, and the runtime libraries, and config tools.

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: @PACKAGE_NAME@, @JS_DEBLIBS@ libcppunit-dev, libdbus-1-dev, liblz4-dev, libjsoncpp-dev, @KRB5_DEBLIBS@ @FUSE3_DEBLIBS@ @OPENSSL_DEBLIBS@ @JAVA_DEBLIBS@ @PYTHON_DEBLIBS@ 
Description: This package contains ridlc, examples, and testcases for RPC-frmwrk.

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@-static
Architecture: any
Depends: @PACKAGE_NAME@ 
Description: This package contains the static libraries for RPC-frmwrk.

